        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cliff Richard, David Kossoff, Lauri Peters, Melvyn Hayes, Teddy Green, Jeremy Bulloch, Una Stubbs, Pamela Hart, Jacqueline Daryl, Lionel Murton, Madge Ryan, Nicholas Phipps, Ron Moody\n- Works: Summer Holiday (1963 film), The Young Lovers, The Next Time, Bachelor Boy\n- Groups: The Shadows\n- Awards: BAFTA\n- Topics: British musical films, hit singles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1954, David Kossoff won a BAFTA for his appearance in The Young Lovers.\n- David Kossoff was a British actor who lived from 24 November 1919 to 23 March 2005.\n- Summer Holiday is a 1963 British CinemaScope and Technicolor musical film featuring singer Cliff Richard.\n- The cast of Summer Holiday includes Lauri Peters, Melvyn Hayes, Teddy Green, Jeremy Bulloch, Una Stubbs, Pamela Hart, Jacqueline Daryl, Lionel Murton, Madge Ryan, David Kossoff, Nicholas Phipps, Ron Moody, and The Shadows.\n- The Next Time, backed with Bachelor Boy, was the first of three number one hit singles from the Cliff Richard musical Summer Holiday.",
